# 3. Roblox: this has become shockingly agent-native

Roblox is probably the most interesting actual **autonomous micro-studio** target.

Roblox Studio now exposes an MCP server. An MCP client can read the game's data model, create/run scripts, edit instances and playtest the place. ([Creator Hub][7])

