# The Oracle needs one conceptual extension

Right now Oracle is largely shaped around:

```text
Market
    ↓
Opportunity
```

That's perfect for:

```text
$5,000 bounty
Upwork job
hackathon
GitHub issue
```

But Roblox, Metaculus and Google OSS patching expose something else:

## An `EarningProgram`

For example:

```text
Market
Roblox creator economy

Program
Roblox experience monetization

Opportunities
individual niches / incentives / contests / market gaps
```

or:

```text
Market
forecasting

Program
Metaculus FutureEval

Opportunity
Summer 2026
MiniBench #57
Market Pulse
```

or:

```text
Market
OSS security

Program
Google Patch Rewards

Opportunity
specific discovered hardening candidate
```

I would introduce:

```python
@dataclass
class EarningProgram:
    id: str
    venue: str
    title: str

    reward_model: str
    recurring: bool

    eligibility: list[str]

    objective_type: str
    feedback_latency_seconds: int | None

